  <Service>
    <Name>WMS</Name>
    <Title>Lightning Detection</Title>
    <Abstract>This nowCOAST map service provides maps depicting the latest lightning detection data from ground-based detection networks. The ground-based networks report strokes/flashes at discrete places and times. Lightning is a significant threat to life, property, and operations on land, in the air, and on the water. Lightning detection data helps decision makers assess the threat and assist weather forecasters in assessing the development or decay of individual thunderstorms and mesoscale convective systems.</Abstract>
